<title>USA: Amcore Financial Inc Q4 net rises.</title>
<headline>Amcore Financial Inc Q4 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>ROCKFORD, Ill. 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.52		    $0.44</p>
<p> Net			  7,390		    6,274</p>
<p> Revs			31,596		   29,676</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  14,238		   14,125</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)  </p>
<p>NOTE: Q4 1996 net interest income $22.3 million vs $20.5 million. Q4 1996 provision for loan losses $996,000 vs $772,000.</p>
<p>		     YEAR</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.86		    $1.30</p>
<p> Net			 26,383		   18,271</p>
<p> Revs		     124,984		  113,419</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  14,214		   14,083</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Full-year 1996 net interest income $86.5 million vs $79.4 million. Full-year 1996 provision for loan losses $5.1 million vs $2.7 million.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
